:: MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Ending Select [nobr]
<<effects>>
随着最后一层线索浮出水面，所有的脉络都已经清晰地摆在你面前。四周静悄悄的，唯有你自己的呼吸声在耳畔回响，一切都将由你此刻的决断画下句点。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[将沉船文物悉数捐献展出，赢得巨额考古奖金与名誉 (0:25)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Ending 1]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 7>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck_ending to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[将海盗金条与碎钻秘密出手，独享巨额横财 (0:25)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Ending 2]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 7>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck_ending to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<brothelicon>><<link [[把水帘秘窟改造成只属于自己的海滨欢愉秘境 (0:25)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Ending 3]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 7>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck_ending to 3>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
<br>
<<loveicon>><<link [[与伴侣乘着小木艇在星夜下出海，共赏荧光海浪 (0:25)|MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Ending 4]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck to 7>><<set $mpQuestShipwreck_ending to 4>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Beach Shipwreck Ending 1 [nobr]
<<effects>>
百年商船的遗物在博物馆设立了专门的展柜，你不仅拿到了丰厚的奖金，还成为了镇上备受尊敬的古物发现者。
<<stress -18>><<trauma -12>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 170>>
<<money 2800>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "Beach")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

