<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[用水晶滴管小心采集花蕊中的红蜜 (0:20)|MP Quest Park Greenhouse Stage 2 Branch A]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpQuestGreenhouse to 3>><</link>>
<br>
