<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[清点酒窖架上封存的百年麦芽威士忌 (0:20)|MP Quest Farmland Mill Stage 2 Branch A]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpQuestMill to 3>><</link>>
<br>
