:: MP Quest Farmland Mill Ending Select [nobr]
<<effects>>
随着最后一层线索浮出水面，所有的脉络都已经清晰地摆在你面前。四周静悄悄的，唯有你自己的呼吸声在耳畔回响，一切都将由你此刻的决断画下句点。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[将传世银器与古典酒爵移交博物馆，获颁丰厚奖金 (0:25)|MP Quest Farmland Mill Ending 1]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestMill to 7>><<set $mpQuestMill_ending to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[独家经营百年私酿，成为丰收街与富商圈的神秘酒庄主 (0:25)|MP Quest Farmland Mill Ending 2]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestMill to 7>><<set $mpQuestMill_ending to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<brothelicon>><<link [[在弥漫着醇厚酒香的干草软榻上尽情释放微醺的欲望 (0:25)|MP Quest Farmland Mill Ending 3]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestMill to 7>><<set $mpQuestMill_ending to 3>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
<br>
<<loveicon>><<link [[与伴侣并肩坐在风车高处的木廊上，共饮交杯佳酿 (0:25)|MP Quest Farmland Mill Ending 4]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestMill to 7>><<set $mpQuestMill_ending to 4>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Farmland Mill Ending 1 [nobr]
<<effects>>
这批见证了小镇酿造史的古董银器被博物馆郑重收藏，为你带来了丰厚的奖金与声望。
<<stress -18>><<trauma -12>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 150>>
<<money 2600>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Farmland Mill Ending 2 [nobr]
<<effects>>
你掌握了整座百年酒窖的库存，每隔一段时间放出几瓶佳酿便能轻松赚取大笔财富。
<<skulduggery 10>><<gskulduggery>>
<<set $blackmoney to ($blackmoney or 0) + 150>>
<<money 4200>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

