<<if 1 gt 0>>
	<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
	<br><br>你顺手捞起了一只打着火漆封条的暗盒，上面印着码头私货的标记，寻常店铺绝不敢收，恐怕只有去麋鹿街或暗渠找熟识门路的人才能换成现钱。
<</if>>
<<if 800 gt 0>>
	<<money 800>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if 5 is 6>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[走向最终的抉择|MP Quest WolfCave Relic Ending Select]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|($mpReturnPassage or "Wolf Cave")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

