<<sneakicon>><<link [[擦拭并收好那架精致的黄铜望远镜 (0:20)|MP Quest Moor Lighthouse Stage 1 Branch B]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpQuestLighthouse to 2>><<skulduggery 3>><</link>><<gskulduggery>>
<br>
<<brothelicon>><<link [[坐在窗边的摇椅上听着海浪声休息 (0:20)|MP Quest Moor Lighthouse Stage 1 Branch C]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpQuestLighthouse to 2>><<arousal 600>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<garousal>>
